+ * faulting stream and attributes), and CBFRSYNRA per bank at
+ * GR1 + 0x400 (GR1 = pagesz above the base): the low 16 bits name
+ * the SID that last faulted on that bank. ARM's standard GBFR/GBPA
+ * offsets do not exist here - reading them says nothing.
